te feature.</li>\n<li>Theme Color Support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Image Compare Init Problem</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: CSS font family.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: HTML Render</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce PHP Code</li>\n<li>Performance Improvement</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce PHP Code</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Performance upgrade</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
